# P0-MODEL-9: bypass Vite's dev proxy.
#
# Vite's dev proxy uses ``http-proxy`` and does not re-stream
# PUT/POST request bodies. That made the 「编辑 Provider」 button
# silently fail with HTTP 400 ("There was an error parsing the body")
# on the FastAPI backend.
#
# Setting this to a full origin makes the frontend talk to the
# backend directly, which works because ``app/core/config.py``
# whitelists ``http://localhost:5173`` and ``http://127.0.0.1:5173``
# in ``cors_origins``. Leave it empty in production (the frontend
# is served behind nginx which proxies /api correctly).
VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8002
